      "description": "Full wire contract: ContentState, encrypted envelope (HERDR-ACTIVITY:1 AAD), relay/APNs requests, registration file."
    },
    {
      "path": "plugin/README.md",
      "description": "Plugin: heeler.pair QR, Pairing Code envelope v1, Bootstrap Key lifecycle, enrollment protocol, notification envelope, registration file, sidebar layout snapshot, notify + activity hooks."
    },
